## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate advanced knowledge of biblical Christian education.
- Apply theological principles to teaching and discipleship.
- Develop Bible-based Christian educational programs.
- Integrate Pentecostal–Charismatic perspectives into Christian education.
- Demonstrate effective teaching and instructional leadership.
- Equip believers for spiritual growth and Christian ministry.
